# Step 02 — Create & link user-role
# Account: 759945100724  OCM: stage  Date: 2026-10-12
#
# The user-role proves to OCM that the OCM user creating the cluster really
# does control this AWS account. One per OCM user per AWS account.
# Name is derived from prefix + OCM username:
#   alebedev-User-alebedev@redhat.com-Role
# Trust is gated on sts:ExternalId == my OCM account ID (2LMLxZNpTtamusby0ItGlLIsT2X),
# as opposed to the ocm-role in step 01 which is gated on the ORG id.
# No managed policy is attached -- it exists purely as an identity assertion.

## Command

AWS_PROFILE=saml rosa create user-role --prefix alebedev --mode auto -y

